[I] A shading language

[T] Slang is a shading language that makes it easier to build and maintain
[T] large shader codebases in a modular and extensible fashion,

[U] https://github.com/shader-slang/slang

[A] shader-slang
[M] The T2 Project <t2@t2-project.org>

[C] extra/tool
[F] CROSS OBJDIR

[L] APL
[V] 2026.19

[D] 7cde63ae3dabba6e9a0834121651936a849e9f9b4f033a61803c3772 shader-slang-2026.19.tar.gz git+https://github.com/shader-slang/slang v2026.19

var_append cmakeopt ' ' "-DSLANG_ENABLE_TESTS=OFF -DSLANG_ENABLE_EXAMPLES=OFF"
var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DSLANG_USE_SYSTEM_MINIZ=ON
var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DSLANG_USE_SYSTEM_LZ4=ON

